pyproject.toml
setup.py
setup.cfg

# transient artifacts of local configure/build debugging, removed at the
# Finished_Port cleanup (2026-09-16). They are regenerable or meaningless:
# configure.bak is autotools', the notebooks come from tools/make_nb_*.py.
configure.bak
configure.run.rc
configure_status.txt
nvcc_paths.txt

# Notebooks and their results are LOCAL ONLY (Luke, 2026-09-23). This tree is
# destined for upstream review and none of these files exist in ViennaRNA, nor
# will they: the notebooks are how the port is measured, not part of what is
# being proposed. Generate with tools/make_nb_*.py and upload to Colab by hand;
# the notebook clones the branch for its SOURCE, so it does not need to be in it.
# Root-anchored so doc/breathe/.../schema.json and any real config are untouched.
/CUDA_RNAFold_*.ipynb
/*.json
/tools/make_nb_*.py
